1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,930
We're team Skorpe Monad.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,520
This is PROHOR.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:07,740
On long missions, a change in an astronaut's
health needs context.

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:11,440
PROHOR compares simulated readings with personal
baselines,

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,995
and prepares a handover for human review.

6
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:21,040
Separately, its research explorer visualizes
NASA's OSD-575 Inspiration4 blood data.

7
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:25,480
Offline after caching, it helps crews prepare a
clearer story for review.

8
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:26,650
PROHOR.

